<p>William Charles "Bill" Broderick was born on September 26, 1917 to Leo and Genevieve (Metcalf) Broderick. His father was a state district judge and longtime attorney in Mandan. He was the oldest son and second of six children born to the couple. His siblings included Jane, John, Margie, Mary and Florence. He attended St. Joseph's Elementary and graduated from Mandan High School in 1935.</p>

